# Security

- Never log raw `refId`, amounts, or recipient names in production — use `SecureLogger`
- Prefer AsyncStorage for lang/theme; SecureStore only for future tokens/secrets
- Share text must go through `sanitizeSharePayload`
- No secrets in client bundle; never use `EXPO_PUBLIC_` for secrets
- Repository port must allow swapping mock for authenticated API later
